		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Sapphire-skinned, beautiful divs embodying betrayal and lust. Delight in turning lovers against each other. Repulsed by the color red.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 19, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +3 (1d6 + pox), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Cursed Dreams</strong>. Pairaka can enter a sleeping mortal's dreams, imparting lusty, perverse nightmares. Far range, CHA 15+ or 1d4 WIS damage (cannot heal while cursed).</p><p></p><p><strong>Pox</strong>. Those struck by or touching pairaka, CON 12+ or 1d6 WIS damage (can't heal while ill). Repeat check once per day; ends on success. Coma at 0 WIS.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
